[en.FOCUS_C04_THE_SUSPECTS_CONFESSION]
Suspect’s Confession

[en.FOCUS_C04_THE_SUSPECTS_CONFESSION_desc]
Unexpectedly, just after the wanted notice was issued, the Sepal Militia encountered Short Fuse, who came to confess — he claimed that he didn’t know what happened that night, but he was covered in blood and suddenly became a wanted suspect, so he came to confess.\nVapor Trail immediately took him back to the Stratusburg Police Station and reported to Sky Stinger. Soon after, the Empire somehow learned of the news and issued a notice requesting that the suspect be sent to Canterlot for interrogation — but of course, Sky Stinger and Vapor Trail would not let the Empire take the suspect away. An emergency interrogation was about to begin.

[zh.FOCUS_C04_THE_SUSPECTS_CONFESSION]
嫌犯的自首

[zh.FOCUS_C04_THE_SUSPECTS_CONFESSION_desc]
没想到，通缉令刚刚发出，萼叶民兵就遇到了前来自首的火药桶 — 他声称自己并不知道那天晚上发生了什么，但是自己身上沾着血，又突然成为了被通缉的嫌疑犯，于是就前来自首了。\n雾轨立刻将其带回了层云堡警察局，并上报了破空。不久后，帝国也不知道何时得知了消息发出通知，要求将嫌犯送至坎特洛特进行审讯 — 但破空和雾轨当然不可能任由帝国直接带走嫌犯。一次突击审讯即将开始。

